        <mxCell id="2fHWJIsyqpY3oujbUqMn-436" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;547&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Level 2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;547&quot; data-end=&quot;615&quot;&gt;Axelsson: Other CSs must become aware of a new system to address it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;617&quot; data-end=&quot;640&quot;&gt;To improve reliability:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Joining and leaving must be announced.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Exit includes advance notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;SoS can prepare, but cannot prevent departure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="290" x="-2620" y="4290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2fHWJIsyqpY3oujbUqMn-437" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Level 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;883&quot; data-end=&quot;950&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Axelsson: A CS may choose to leave; it may also be forced to leave.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;952&quot; data-end=&quot;975&quot;&gt;To improve reliability:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Joining the SoS requires approval.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Joining a constellation requires agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Withdrawal from a constellation requires approval and may be delayed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Membership can be revoked.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Entry/exit become controlled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="190" width="290" x="-1830" y="4370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2fHWJIsyqpY3oujbUqMn-438" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1268&quot; data-end=&quot;1395&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Level 4&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1268&quot; data-end=&quot;1395&quot;&gt;Axelsson: Joining constellations may involve contractual arrangements; CS may leave when collaboration is no longer meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1397&quot; data-end=&quot;1420&quot;&gt;To improve reliability:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Roles are explicitly modeled.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Constituents perform an allocated role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Role adjustments can be requested or proposed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Role reassignment may prevent withdrawal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;Structural reconfiguration reduces reliance on denial and compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="310" x="-460" y="4470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="2fHWJIsyqpY3oujbUqMn-473" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;34&quot; data-end=&quot;225&quot;&gt;Joining, leaving, and role changes are inherent SoS behaviors and not failures per se; however, their effects manifest as observable disturbances that must be tolerated (cf. Ferreira et al.).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;120&quot; data-end=&quot;170&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;In our CEP context, DT constituents act as black-box event producers. When a constituent disappears, reappears, or permanently leaves, disruptions in event streams directly impact pattern detection and outputs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="280" x="-2980" y="6690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
